  "document": "I Know You\n\"I Know You\" is a song recorded by American recording artist and songwriter Skylar Grey for the soundtrack to the film \"Fifty Shades of Grey\" (2015). The song was written by Grey and Canadian composer/producer Stephan Moccio and was co-produced by Moccio and Dan Heath. It was released as the second promotional single from the \"Fifty Shades of Grey\" soundtrack on February 3, 2015."
